# Rolling around Valencia with the full random traffic (80 cars from world.rng: junctions, the
# bubble, yielding) for 15 s. It guards traffic determinism (also run Node vs Chromium in check --full).
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
hold up 0..300
hold left 400..460
hold up 500..900
run 1800
expect min skater.pos.z > 1
